 rel="manifest" href="/manifest.webmanifest"/><meta name="keywords" content="AI Product Engineer,AI Engineer,Generative AI,Agents,Agentic AI,Complaion,Machine Learning,Software Engineer,Lorenzo Germini,Portfolio,Resume,CV,LLM agents,RAG,Evals &amp; tracing,Full-stack development,Python"/><meta name="creator" content="Lorenzo Germini"/><meta name="robots" content="index, follow"/><meta name="googlebot" content="index, follow, max-video-preview:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1"/><link rel="canonical" href="https://lorenzogermini.com"/><link rel="alternate" type="text/markdown" href="https://lorenzogermini.com/index.md"/><meta property="og:title" content="Lorenzo Germini | AI Product Engineer"/><meta property="og:description" content="AI product engineer. I build the AI engine behind Complaion, a compliance platform for European SMEs, and write about building with AI at germinai."/><meta property="og:url" content="https://lorenzogermini.com"/><meta property="og:site_name" content="Lorenzo Germini"/><meta property="og:locale" content="en_US"/><meta property="og:image:alt" content="Lorenzo Germini — AI Product Engineer"/><meta property="og:image:type" content="image/png"/><meta property="og:image" content="https://lorenzogermini.com/opengraph-image?40cf4f279b89dfa1"/><meta property="og:image:width" content="1200"/><meta property="og:image:height" content="630"/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:creator" content="@spleenboi_"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="Lorenzo Germini | AI Product Engineer"/><meta name="twitter:description" content="AI product engineer. I build the AI engine behind Complaion, a compliance platform for European SMEs, and write about building with AI at germinai."/><meta name="twitter:image:alt" content="Lorenzo Germini — AI Product Engineer"/><meta name="twitter:image:type" content="image/png"/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://lorenzogermini.com/opengraph-image?40cf4f279b89dfa1"/><meta name="twitter:image:width" content="1200"/><meta name="twitter:image:height" content="630"/><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico?favicon.fe6439a2.ico" sizes="48x48" type="image/x-icon"/><link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-icon.png?apple-icon.caeb57f9.png" sizes="180x180" type="image/png"/><script>(function(){try{var t=localStorage.getItem("theme");if(t==="dark"||(!t&&matchMedia("(prefers-color-scheme:dark)").matches)){document.documentElement.classList.add("dark")}}catch(e){}})()</script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/a6dad97d9634a72d.js?dpl=dpl_A9rXGX5umNK7doEpmuVDCvnb3vEE" noModule=""></script></head><body class="antialiased"><div hidden=""><!--$--><!--/$--></div><a href="#main-content" class="focus:bg-accent focus:text-accent-foreground sr-only focus:not-sr-only focus:fixed focus:top-4 focus:left-4 focus:z-[100] focus:rounded-md focus:px-4 focus:py-2 focus:text-sm focus:font-medium focus:shadow-lg print:hidden">Skip to content</a><!--&--><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"ProfilePage","dateCreated":"2024-01-01","dateModified":"2026-09-30","mainEntity":{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","@id":"https://lorenzogermini.com/#person","name":"Lorenzo Germini","jobTitle":"AI Product Engineer","description":"I'm an AI product engineer: I ship AI products end-to-end, from the models and infrastructure to the interface people actually touch, and stay on the hook for whether the thing helps anyone. Full stack in the literal sense: backend, frontend, and the product calls in between.\n\nThese days that's the AI engine behind Complaion, a compliance platform for European SMEs getting and keeping ISO certifications. The interesting problem is making the agents in the background reliable enough to trust with real compliance work, and knowing when they're not. Before that: AI for pharma manufacturing at GSK, AI R&D in digital health, and a GenAI EdTech startup I built as founding engineer. The through-line hasn't changed: technical depth only matters when it meets a real user problem.\n\nOutside work: sports, side projects, and rabbit holes on tech entrepreneurship and biohacking.","url":"https://lorenzogermini.com","image":"https://lorenzogermini.com/lorenzo-germini-portrait.jpg","sameAs":["https://github.com/Blaise-g","https://www.linkedin.com/in/lorenzogermini/","https://twitter.com/spleenboi_"],"email":"lorenzo.germini@icloud.com","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Cuneo","addressRegion":"Piedmont","addressCountry":"IT"},"alumniOf":[{"@type":"EducationalOrganization","name":"Swiss Federal Institute of Technology Lausanne (EPFL)"},{"@type":"EducationalOrganization","name":"Polytechnic of Turin"}],"worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Complaion","url":"https://www.complaion.com/"},"knowsAbout":["LLM agents","RAG","Evals & tracing","Full-stack development","Python","Coding agents in the loop"],"knowsLanguage":["English","Italian","French"],"hasOccupation":{"@type":"Occupation","name":"AI Product Engineer","occupationalCategory":"15-1299.00","occupationLocation":{"@type":"City","name":"Cuneo"},"skills":"LLM agents, RAG, Evals & tracing, Full-stack development, Python, Coding agents in the loop"},"hasCredential":[{"@type":"EducationalOccupationalCredential","name":"MSc in Life Sciences Engineering (specialization in Neuroscience & Neuroengineering)","credentialCategory":"degree","recognizedBy":{"@type":"EducationalOrganization","name":"Swiss Federal Institute of Technology Lausanne (EPFL)"}},{"@type":"EducationalOccupationalCredential","name":"Bachelor's Degree in Electrical Engineering","credentialCategory":"degree","recognizedBy":{"@type":"EducationalOrganization","name":"Polytechnic of Turin"}}]},"speakable":{"@type":"SpeakableSpecification","cssSelector":["h1","h2","[data-speakable]"]}}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://lorenzogermini.com/#website","name":"Lorenzo Germini - Portfolio","url":"https://lorenzogermini.com","description":"I'm an AI product engineer: I ship AI products end-to-end, from the models and infrastructure to the interface people actually touch, and stay on the hook for whether the thing helps anyone. Full stack in the literal sense: backend, frontend, and the product calls in between.\n\nThese days that's the AI engine behind Complaion, a compliance platform for European SMEs getting and keeping ISO certifications. The interesting problem is making the agents in the background reliable enough to trust with real compliance work, and knowing when they're not. Before that: AI for pharma manufacturing at GSK, AI R&D in digital health, and a GenAI EdTech startup I built as founding engineer. The through-line hasn't changed: technical depth only matters when it meets a real user problem.\n\nOutside work: sports, side projects, and rabbit holes on tech entrepreneurship and biohacking.","inLanguage":"en","author":{"@id":"https://lorenzogermini.com/#person"},"publisher":{"@id":"https://lorenzogermini.com/#person"}}</script><main id="main-content" tabindex="-1" class="scroll-mt-12 focus-visible:shadow-none"><div class="min-h-screen"><div data-testid="masthead-rule" class="animate-fade-in-up border-ink border-b-2"><header data-testid="masthead-inset" data-profile-orientation="masthead" class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 md:px-10 print:max-w-none print:px-0 py-3 lg:py-4 print:pt-0"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-8"><div class="flex items-baseline gap-x-4"><p data-testid="masthead-name" data-identity-name="true" class="font-display text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight">Lorenzo Germini</p><p data-testid="masthead-role" class="text-faint font-label hidden text-xs tracking-[0.12em] uppercase lg:block print:hidden">AI Product Engineer</p></div><div class="flex items-center gap-6"><nav aria-label="Site" data-testid="masthead-routes" class="text-faint font-label hidden gap-5