d infrastructure to the interface people actually touch, and stay on the hook for whether the thing helps anyone. Full stack in the literal sense: backend, frontend, and the product calls in between.\",{\"children\":\"I'm an AI product engineer: I ship AI products end-to-end, from the models and infrastructure to the interface people actually touch, and stay on the hook for whether the thing helps anyone. Full stack in the literal sense: backend, frontend, and the product calls in between.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"These days that's the AI engine behind Complaion, a compliance platform for European SMEs getting and keeping ISO certifications. The interesting problem is making the agents in the background reliable enough to trust with real compliance work, and knowing when they're not. Before that: AI for pharma manufacturing at GSK, AI R\u0026D in digital health, and a GenAI EdTech startup I built as founding engineer. The through-line hasn't changed: technical depth only matters when it meets a real user problem.\",{\"children\":\"These days that's the AI engine behind Complaion, a compliance platform for European SMEs getting and keeping ISO certifications. The interesting problem is making the agents in the background reliable enough to trust with real compliance work, and knowing when they're not. Before that: AI for pharma manufacturing at GSK, AI R\u0026D in digital health, and a GenAI EdTech startup I built as founding engineer. The through-line hasn't changed: technical depth only matters when it meets a real user problem.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"Outside work: sports, side projects, and rabbit holes on tech entrepreneurship and biohacking.\",{\"children\":\"Outside work: sports, side projects, and rabbit holes on tech entrepreneurship and biohacking.\"}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"2c:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"flex min-h-0 flex-col gap-y-3 animate-fade-in-up max-w-[42rem] scroll-mt-24 print:gap-y-1\",\"id\":\"work\",\"data-reading-measure\":\"true\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-accent font-label text-[15px] font-semibold tracking-[0.18em] uppercase\",\"children\":\"Work\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-accent/30 h-px w-12\"}]],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-7 print:space-y-1\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"div\",\"Complaion-May 2025\",{\"className\":\"print-keep-together grid gap-1 sm:grid-cols-[8rem_1fr] sm:gap-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-faint font-mono text-xs tabular-nums sm:pt-1.5\",\"children\":[\"May 2025\",\" – \",\"Present\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-xl leading-snug\",\"children\":[\"AI Engineer\",\" ·\",\" \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"className\":\"touch-target underline-offset-4 hover:underline\",\"href\":\"https://www.complaion.com/\",\"children\":\"Complaion\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-body mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-pretty print:text-[12px]\",\"children\":\"The AI engine behind the product: LLM agents doing compliance work over ISO documentation in the background, and the eval harness that shows when they can't be trusted. Shipping features end-to-end, from definition through AI, backend, and frontend to production.\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"Stealth GenAI Startup-Nov 2024\",{\"className\":\"print-keep-together grid gap-1 sm:grid-cols-[8rem_1fr] sm:gap-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-faint font-mono text-xs tabular-nums sm:pt-1.5\",\"children\":[\"Nov 2024\",\" – \",\"Apr 2025\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-xl leading-snug\",\"children\":[\"Founding AI Engineer\",\" ·\",\" \",\"Stealth GenAI Startup\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-body mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-pretty print:text-[12px]\",\"children\":\"Backend and GenAI API layer from zero on AWS; a RAG stack with custom parsing for handwritten input, plus the tracing and evals to tune retrieval.\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"GSK-Sep 2023\",{\"className\":\"print-keep-together grid gap-1 sm:grid-cols-[8rem_1fr] sm:gap-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-faint font-mono text-xs tabular-nums sm:pt-1.5\",\"children\":[\"Sep 2023\",\" – \",\"Oct 2024\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-xl leading-snug\",\"children\":[\"AI Engineer\",\" ·\",\" \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"className\":\"touch-target underline-offset-4 hover:underline\",\"href\":\"https://www.gsk.com/en-gb/home/\",\"children\":\"GSK\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-body mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-pretty print:text-[12px]\",\"children\":\"Time-series forecasting and anomaly detection on plant sensor data, semantic NLP for fault detection, and a water-rejection strategy projected at 10,000 m³/year.\"}]]}]]}]],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"print-keep-together grid gap-1 sm:grid-cols-[8rem_1fr] sm:gap-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-faint font-mono text-xs tabular-nums sm:pt-1.5\",\"children\":[\"2021\",\" – \",\"2023\"]}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"text-faint space-y-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-pretty print:text-[12px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"A Stable Diffusion interior-design MVP, killed on the evidence\",{\"children\":\"A Stable Diffusion interior-design MVP, killed on the evidence\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"Biomedical-literature summarisation at Burgeon Labs\",{\"children\":\"Biomedical-literature summarisation at Burgeon Labs\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"Fill-parameter ML at Roche\",{\"children\":\"Fill-parameter ML at Roche\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"EPFL MSc, Life Sciences Engineering\",{\"children\":\"EPFL MSc, Life Sciences Engineering\"}]]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 print:hidden\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"/cv\",\"className\":\"text-accent border-accent touch-target font-label border-b pb-0.5 t